  unitName: Heavy Guard Nevsky
  unitId: 50323
  unitNumber: 651
  description: A heavily armored soldier who appears in the tales about the migration
    of a group of refugees towards El Gaia. His story began when Reed and his party
    helped him out of a predicament he he'd fallen into following an attack from
    the god army. Though he never swore fealty to Reed, it is said he would appear
    out of nowhere whenever one of the party members was in danger to rescue them.
    It has also been told that he'd offer advice at the time of the rescue, but apparently
    Aneil was the only one to take this advice seriously, while everyone else never
    really stopped to listen.
  summonDesc: The sealed door has opened.<br>I understand.<br>I'll lend you my power
    without falter!
  fusionDesc: What a convenient technique...<br>Things have really advanced.<br>But
    don't trust everyone so easily.
